From 345870510d2b044d9ebc5bf6a086bc384f2ee9d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harald Anlauf <anlauf@gmx.de>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:52:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fortran: Fix FINDLOC with DIM and MASK [PR127845]

The runtime library templates for FINDLOC did not advance properly
through the MASK array argument when MASK and DIM are present.

	PR fortran/127845

libgfortran/ChangeLog:

	* generated/findloc1_c10.c (mfindloc1_c10): Regenerate.
	* generated/findloc1_c16.c (mfindloc1_c16): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_c17.c (mfindloc1_c17): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_c4.c (mfindloc1_c4): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_c8.c (mfindloc1_c8): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_i1.c (mfindloc1_i1): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_i16.c (mfindloc1_i16): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_i2.c (mfindloc1_i2): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_i4.c (mfindloc1_i4): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_i8.c (mfindloc1_i8): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_r10.c (mfindloc1_r10): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_r16.c (mfindloc1_r16): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_r17.c (mfindloc1_r17): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_r4.c (mfindloc1_r4): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_r8.c (mfindloc1_r8): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_s1.c (mfindloc1_s1): Likewise.
	* generated/findloc1_s4.c (mfindloc1_s4): Likewise.
	* m4/ifindloc1.m4: Properly advance through MASK array argument when
	MASK and DIM are present.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* gfortran.dg/findloc_11.f90: New test.

(cherry picked from commit 0a3124969d7cf120d26d7044deec17a7f23d169e)
